  "path_source": "reze decompiled/pak/index.tsv and RE2_RT_STM_Release.list, verified by re_pak KPKA v4 hash lookup",
  "notes": [
    "ui3100_iam is the in-game map marker atlas. It contains map features and the four suit keys, not consumable item icons.",
    "RE2 renders inventory items as 3D models, so no 2D herb, ammo, spray or gunpowder icons ship in the UI textures.",
    "ui3000_iam is the menu glyph atlas; ui4010_icon_iam is the Records gallery render grid.",
    "Categories without a matching shipped icon use the closest game-native glyph or render and are marked approximate."
  ]
